THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

src/openvr/openvr_min.h contains type declarations whose binary layout must
match OpenVR's public headers (Valve Corporation, BSD-3-Clause). They are
reproduced only to the extent needed for ABI compatibility.

reference/openvr_api.dll, when present, is Valve's binary used as a build input
to generate a matching export table. It is not redistributed: the directory is
git-ignored and the file must be supplied from a local Elite Dangerous install.

